ce":"中書令","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"擬加之職；苦讓遂不受，非已任中書令。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003:m0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"穆帝","kind":"person","person_id":"84i_4jp_gmc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003:m0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"敬和","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003:m0091","start":91,"end":92,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"84i_4jp_gmc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003:m0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"洽","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003:m0178","start":178,"end":179,"surface":"珣","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003:m0180","start":180,"end":181,"surface":"瑉","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":74,"last_line":75,"revision_id":1756144,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-065","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-065-wangdao-family"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-065","source_id":"s-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷六十五（數位選錄）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7065&oldid=1756144","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7065&oldid=1756144","revision_id":1756144,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"王導傳首、弟與六子名單、王洽完整附傳、王珣附傳末段；其餘傳文待錄。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未親核底本影像","response_sha256":"adb88c06681ebadbe1008de55022005077695c188196a2adbea1fd074cf8e1dc","wikitext_sha256":"98c7262170dcc4bf0f7e831fb693e46ff819e46fdd9407a484c787185901550a","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"只展開單字顯示語法、YL年號模板及粗體標記；不改原字。數位章首notes與小標題不作正文證據。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p001","source_lines":[12,13],"raw_quote":"　　王導，字茂弘，光祿大夫覽之孫也。父裁，鎮軍司馬。導少有風鑒，識量清遠。年十四，陳留高士張公見而奇之，謂其從兄敦曰：「此兒容貌志氣，將相之器也。」初襲祖爵即丘子。司空劉實尋引爲東閣祭酒，遷秘書郎、太子舍人、尚書郎，並不行。-{後}-參東海王越軍事。","raw_quote_sha256":"55cfcecac55deae6b31938ff8f5b24adfaf30edcacaf2d3f10689b893f57ccef","selected_text_sha256":"4305dd97e4210dddc55b1bc1be6dd65e205a9e76a083028fef942d7fb9f4b63e","begin_anchor":"王導，字茂弘，光祿大夫覽之孫也","end_anchor":"郎，並不行。後參東海王越軍事。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p002","source_lines":[60,61],"raw_quote":"　　二弟：穎、敞，少與導俱知名，時人以穎方溫太真，以敞比鄧伯道，並早卒。導六子：'''悅、恬、洽、協、邵、薈'''。","raw_quote_sha256":"79aca2610036b59920f915415447b07befdc34fd18f6d4d03db4063313b6e256","selected_text_sha256":"72a361a1bd48a41d842525c3faf54958276d645db494bbdbc8a2503d721c2c68","begin_anchor":"二弟：穎、敞，少與導俱知名，時","end_anchor":"六子：悅、恬、洽、協、邵、薈。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p003","source_lines":[74,75],"raw_quote":"　　洽字敬和，導諸子中最知名，與荀羨俱有美稱。弱冠，歷散騎、中書郎、中軍長史、司徒左長史、建武將軍、呉郡內史。徵拜領軍，尋加中書令，固讓，表疏十上。穆帝詔曰：「敬和清裁貴令，昔爲中書郎，吾時尚小，數呼見，意甚親之。今所以用爲令，既機任須才，且欲時時相見，共講文章，待以友臣之義。而累表固讓，甚違本懷。其催洽令拜。」苦讓，遂不受。{{YL|昇平二年}}卒於官，年三十六。二子：珣、瑉。","raw_quote_sha256":"684bc2179ddff68edb739dca10f31036191b0f7af4a76d25ad95faf63050c457","selected_text_sha256":"48268ce33170893d17253498e1418567cc0158bcd6c1d2d491a72cbce20d1d84","begin_anchor":"洽字敬和，導諸子中最知名，與荀","end_anchor":"於官，年三十六。二子：珣、瑉。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p004","source_lines":[88,89],"raw_quote":"　　初，珣既與謝安有隙，在東聞安薨，便出京師，詣族弟獻之，曰：「吾欲哭謝公。」獻之驚曰：「所望於法護。」於是直前哭之甚慟。法護，珣小字也。珣五子：弘、虞、柳、孺、曇首，宋世並有高名。","raw_quote_sha256":"a94ba99a0de66bb37f92c4f6a67ad9f0cb5f0c9ba653a91696ecc19729b5a990","selected_text_sha256":"98f997a89e095667a540467d3f62c511eeb1774a196825a3f9b79c322e50c6d4","begin_anchor":"初，珣既與謝安有隙，在東聞安薨","end_anchor":"、柳、孺、曇首，宋世並有高名。"}]}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAB","representative_source_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAB","source_person_ids":["7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAB"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA","source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu065-wang-014","assembly_id":"family-langye-wang-dao","root_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji","status":"editorial_preferred","human_reviewed":false}}
